The '''Warding Diamathame''' is a {{Rare}} [[Wand]] in the [[Rift Dimension]].

== Obtaining ==
A '''Warding Diamathame''' can be claimed from {{NPCSprite|Sorcerer Okron}} at the beginning of their quest. A '''Warding Diamathame''' can then be purchased from them for {{Motes|1,000}} after imbuing the Glyphs on all sides of Okron's house.

